## MCP Registry

A directory of remote Model Context Protocol servers BuiltWith has detected on company websites,
discovered from each site's published `llms.txt`. Every server and every tool has its own page.

- Registry home: https://builtwith.com/mcp-registry
- Category: `https://builtwith.com/mcp-registry/[category-slug]`
  - Example: https://builtwith.com/mcp-registry/developer-tools
  - Newest discoveries: https://builtwith.com/mcp-registry/recently-added
- Search: `https://builtwith.com/mcp-registry?search=[term]` - matches domains, endpoint URLs,
  tool names and tool descriptions
- Single MCP server: `https://builtwith.com/mcp/[domain]`
  - Example: https://builtwith.com/mcp/globalsurfari.com
- Single MCP tool: `https://builtwith.com/mcp/[domain]/tool/[tool-slug]`
- Sitemap for all of the above: https://builtwith.com/mcp-sitemap.xml
